'''Festive Otter '''(ぼったくラッコ ''Botakku Rakko'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Summer Break Cats|Summer Diary]] and [[Megaton Blast (Insane)|Megaton Blast]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

