[[Megaton Blast (Insane)]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
A festival-themed [[Otta-smack-u]], it has higher health, higher damage, and can knockback cats.

==Strategy==
Treat it like a buffed Otta-smack-u with 2 knockbacks instead of 1.

