==Trivia==
*In the [[Media:Summervac 2023 img01-06 en 3.png|event poster]] for [[Summer Break Cats]], Festive Otter is referred to as Carny Otta, which was the only name it had until it was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*Festive Otter's Japanese name, Botakku Rakko (ぼたっくラッコ), is derived from ぼったくる ''botakkuru'' (to intentionally overcharge; to rip off) and 海獺 ''rakko'' (sea otter).

